  "overview": {
    "description": "环境配置管理服务，提供环境实体的完整生命周期管理，并对登录凭据（密码、私钥）进行加密保护。通过与 SSHService 的内部契约完成连接测试，向 SecurityService 调用加解密工具。所有操作均绑定到具体项目，确保多项目隔离。",
    "dependencies": [
      "SSHService",
      "SecurityService",
      "DatabaseService"
    ],
    "tech_stack": [
      "TypeScript",
      "Electron (Node.js runtime)",
      "better-sqlite3",
      "ssh2 (indirect)",
      "node-crypto (via SecurityService)"
    ]
  },
